issive cool-white front headlamp assemblies, five-pod roof light bar, amber front markers, and red rear lamps","geometry":"Original optimized shell geometry and existing curved window openings preserved; only livery vertex colors, a side decal texture, and detail meshes were added","lightingBehavior":"Emissive appearance is included in the GLTF; dynamic light casting and in-game on/off controls are not part of this asset yet"},"orientationCorrection":{"frontDirectionInSourceAsset":"+Z","gameWrapperYawDegrees":180,"headlights":"Moved to the +Z nose so they face the simulator forward direction after the game wrapper rotation","tailLights":"Moved to the -Z rear panel","roofLightBar":"Moved from the rear-side roof edge to the front roof crown and lowered into contact with the roof surface","otherDetails":"Grille, front bumper, orange front-fender/hood stripes rotated with the correct front direction; bilateral door number decals unchanged"},"lightingPlacement":{"front":"Headlights, amber markers, grille and bumper sit on the actual +Z front nose panel","rear":"Red/amber tail lamps sit just outside the -Z rear panel and face rearward","roof":"Removed the extra floating rectangular bar; illuminated the five integrated CAD roof-pod lenses instead","validation":"Original shell and side-window geometry are unchanged; lamp locations follow the source CAD body ends"}},"images":[{"bufferView":840,"mimeType":"image/png","name":"Concept4 desert racing side number decal"}],"samplers":[{"magFilter":9729,"minFilter":9987,"wrapS":33071,"wrapT":33071}],"textures":[{"sampler":0,"source":0}],"extensionsUsed":["KHR_materials_emissive_strength"]}